{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vwVvH3oGXK1794749842.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>深水埗一幢大廈外牆有金屬碎片剝落，擊中一名女子，她受傷送院。</p><p></p><p>現場是深水埗鴨寮街1至7號。警方下午4時許接報，一名女子途經大廈時，被一塊金屬碎片擊中頭部。該名女子頭部受傷，清醒報警，救護員到場後為她包紮後，送上救護車送院治理。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FALLING-1830.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FO3rHTBitK1794749851.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>有警員向受傷女子的母親查問，並檢視碎片跌落的位置；又登上附近大廈頂層觀察，暫時未能確認碎片從哪個位置剝落。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T14:22:13.280682+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T13:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T23:22:34.783948+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T14:15:42.248448+00:00","content_hash":"2646e8c0464481b364b5f96501d7aa7fffeddf938c760881ca603378a0470f4f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T14:22:13.280682+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}